{"id":2113,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div data-page-id=\"XfxHffhI3dTt5oc2MpecYlsCnxh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><div>各系、各位教师及学生：</div><p>根据《中北大学本科教材管理办法》（校教[2021]10号）、《电气与控制工程学院本科生教材选用管理实施细则》（教发〔2025〕5号）文件精神，为保障本科教学质量，规范教材选用流程，确保教材的思想性、科学性、先进性与适用性，经各授课教师申报、各系初审、学院审核，现将我院2025/2026学年第2学期拟选用的本科教材信息予以公示。</p><p>公示期为五天。公示期间，如对拟选用教材有异议，请拨打咨询电话：3921182，或向学院教学办公室反映。</p></div><p></p><div data-page-id=\"XfxHffhI3dTt5oc2MpecYlsCnxh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><div><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BM4-G4UmrVnmvPMfR67n7rko7-iL8Lk4nRWfLz-DM4CPozC0gihFp2hmCIa0okysU1yDU1hRMll8nR-DnRTkLRUZU8rfUzCiUm7PoRV2ozrFoRvPnz9Dn7QFLzV2Lz-Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7PLmlJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21125&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/87B6BC5E4D26D9B048CEAA65B1181F95/871E86DF/11F12\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BM4-G4UmrVnmvPMfR67n7rko7-iL8Lk4nRWfLz-DM4CPozC0gihFp2hmCIa0okysU1yDU1hRMll8nR-DnRTkLRUZU8rfUzCiUm7PoRV2ozrFoRvPnz9Dn7QFLzV2Lz-Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7PLmlJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21125&e=.png\"></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ece.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BM4-G4UmrVnmvPMfR67n7rko7-iL8Lk4nRWfLz-DM4CPozC0gihFp2hmCIa0okysU1yDU1hRMll8nR-DnRTkLRUZU8rfUzCiUm7PoRV2ozrFoRvPnz9Dn7QFLzV2Lz-Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7PLmlJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21125&e=.png"}